{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>進擊巨人聯乘Sanrio</p><p>《進擊的巨人》與Sanrio迎來聯名五週年，官方於 2026 年 10 月推出全新限定系列，並於日本全國五大城市開設期間限定 POP-UP STORE。今次聯乘將《進擊的巨人》人氣角色與Sanrio角色配對，角色們換上黑白禮服並手持專屬旗幟，與Sanrio角色同框，營造帥氣與療癒並存的獨特畫面。</p><p>必買公仔/立牌/海報</p><p>周邊商品陣容豐富，包括布偶裝吉祥物（附旗幟造型壓克力鑰匙圈）、壓克力立牌（一般版及 BIG 大型款）、透明海報、畫布板、金屬光澤徽章套組（網路限定）、票券造型卡片、資料夾、手機貼紙及束口托特包等。 其中布偶裝吉祥物讓角色戴上三麗鷗頭套，一本正經的表情配上圓滾滾外型，釋放罕見的萌系魅力。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179095683930745655_9787897556abfd5279a4d8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179095684108021660_6450689346abfd52977afc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179095684320026249_442615466abfd52b8285d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179095684495175769_21089613826abfd52d55cb2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179095684735640787_20103350436abfd52fc4463.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179095684910265294_2902275076abfd5316dec2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179095685066389321_16408727816abfd533501cb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179095685257636791_158220756abfd534ef779.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T16:19:52.519980+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":391,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}